# Regression (Round XXIV Track A):
# The "zero-cost move" advice mechanism was deleted because it emitted
# invalid advice 100% of the time (D31 full-strict rejects `!` at any
# bare-param call site with E_OwnershipMismatch). This fixture pins the
# AXIS: bare Ptr param at last-use in the throws-Ptr Ok-wrap leg of
# `lower_return` (Caller #2 of the deleted `record_param_cloned`).
# Asserts NO warning fires on `gg build`.
#
# RED-verify: with the deletion applied, a temp `eprintln!("zero-cost move
# probe")` added early in `src/main.rs` build path made this fixture go
# RED (the helper detects the substring); removing the probe returned it
# to GREEN. The class-guard lint `move_suggestion_advice_absent_from_source`
# is the durable reintroduction guard; this fixture pins the axis.

Vector[int] passthru(Vector[int] a) throws String:
    return a

void main():
    Vector[int] v = [9, 8, 7]
    Vector[int] w = passthru(v)! catch (m): [0]
    print(w.len())
